msgstr "调度器利用率"

msgid "Select a value"
msgstr "请选择"

msgid "Sets software and hardware flow offloading together and reloads the firewall. This may interrupt connections. Bridge filtering is not an offload switch; configure AP networking in the native network settings and follow your firmware documentation."
msgstr "同时设置软件和硬件流量卸载并重新加载防火墙，可能中断连接。桥接过滤不是卸载开关；请在原生网络设置中配置 AP 网络并参考固件文档。"

